BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIO Roundtable
DESCRIPTION:TAI’s Chief Information Officer (CIO) Roundtable convenes 
 C-level information technology leaders to exchange strategic insights on
  shared successes\, challenges\, and emerging best practices.\n\nThe rou
 ndtable meets hybrid on a quarterly basis and is exclusively reserved fo
 r technology executives of TAI member organizations with CIO (or compara
 ble) job titles. Complete the form below to express your interest in par
 ticipating. Once confirmed\, you’ll receive meeting details and calend
 ar invitations.\n\nSubmit Your Interest to Join
